<title>USA: DSP Group names Avi Basher CFO.</title>
<headline>DSP Group names Avi Basher CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSP Group Inc said on Monday it has appointed Avi Basher as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Basher joins DSP from Interpharm Laboratories Ltd, where he was chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Basher replaces John Goldsberry, who has resigned to pursue other interests. Goldsberry will remain a consultant to DSP for six months.</p>
</text>
